{"seq":2,"slug":"consistency-models","title":"一致性模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-sampling-solvers/acceleration/consistency-models","wordCount":1830,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"一致性模型\">一致性模型</h1><p>2023 年宋飏团队提出一致性模型，给少步生成换了个角度：与其让学生模仿老师走两步（<a href=\"step-distillation\">步数蒸馏</a> 的思路），不如训练一个函数，让它把 ODE 轨迹上<strong>任意一点</strong>都直接映射到这条轨迹的起点——也就是干净样本。如果真能做到，那从任何噪声水平，一次调用就能成像。这一篇讲清这个「自一致性」约束、CM/LCM/sCM/MeanFlow 这条快速演化的家族，以及它为何成了 2026 年从零训练少步模型的最前沿。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-自一致性约束\">核心概念：自一致性约束</h2><p>设 PF-ODE（见 <a href=\"../foundations/sde-ode-view\">SDE 与 ODE 视角</a>）的一条轨迹从噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 通向干净样本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。定义一个<strong>一致性函数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\theta(x_t, t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，目标是：对轨迹上任意时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，它都输出同一个终点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。形式化为两条约束：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>边界条件</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mtext> 在同一轨迹上</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_\\theta(x_0, 0) = x_0 \\quad(\\text{边界条件}) \\qquad f_\\theta(x_t, t) = f_\\theta(x_{t&#x27;}, t&#x27;)\\quad \\forall t, t&#x27; \\text{ 在同一轨迹上}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">边界条件</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.328em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6828em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.786em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">在同一轨迹上</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>第二条就是「自一致性」——同一轨迹上不同点的输出必须一致。一旦训成，采样只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0 = f_\\theta(x_T, T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<strong>单步</strong>完成。也可以多步：先单步到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，再加噪到中间水平、再单步，几步迭代细化（CM 的「多步采样」），在 2~4 步换取更好画质。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;噪声 x_T&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;一致性函数 f_θ&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;中间点 x_t&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;    D[&quot;近干净点 x_t&#39;&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;    B --&gt; E[&quot;同一终点 x_0&lt;br/&gt;自一致性约束&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F{&quot;采样方式&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|单步| G[&quot;x_0 = f_θ(x_T, T)&lt;br/&gt;1 次调用&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|多步| H[&quot;去噪→加噪→去噪&lt;br/&gt;2-4 步细化&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"噪声 x_T\"] --&gt; B[\"一致性函数 f_θ\"]\n    C[\"中间点 x_t\"] --&gt; B\n    D[\"近干净点 x_t'\"] --&gt; B\n    B --&gt; E[\"同一终点 x_0&lt;br/&gt;自一致性约束\"]\n    E --&gt; F{\"采样方式\"}\n    F --&gt;|单步| G[\"x_0 = f_θ(x_T, T)&lt;br/&gt;1 次调用\"]\n    F --&gt;|多步| H[\"去噪→加噪→去噪&lt;br/&gt;2-4 步细化\"]</pre><p>训练有两条途径：<strong>一致性蒸馏（CD）</strong> 用一个预训练扩散模型生成轨迹上的相邻点对来监督；<strong>一致性训练（CT）</strong> 完全从零、不需老师，直接用数据估计轨迹。CD 更稳，CT 更纯粹但更难训。</p>\n<h2 id=\"家族演化-cm-lcm-scm-meanflow\">家族演化：CM → LCM → sCM → MeanFlow</h2><p>这条线在 2023–2026 间演化极快，每一代都解决前一代的痛点。下表理出主脉络：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>年份</th>\n<th>关键突破</th>\n<th>典型步数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CM（一致性模型）</td>\n<td>2023</td>\n<td>自一致性约束，单步成像</td>\n<td>1–4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>LCM（潜一致性）</td>\n<td>2023</td>\n<td>搬到潜空间 + 蒸馏 SD，可配 LCM-LoRA 即插</td>\n<td>2–8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sCM（连续一致性）</td>\n<td>2025</td>\n<td>简化/稳定连续时间训练，去掉离散化误差</td>\n<td>1–2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MeanFlow</td>\n<td>2025</td>\n<td>直接参数化「平均速度」，去掉自一致性双时约束</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>LCM</strong> 是工程上影响最大的一步：它把一致性蒸馏用到 Stable Diffusion 的潜空间，并以 LCM-LoRA 形式发布——一个小 LoRA 套到现成 SD 模型上就能 4 步出图，零门槛普及。<strong>sCM</strong>（OpenAI 2025 年「简化、稳定、扩展连续时间一致性模型」一文）解决了 CM 在连续时间下训练发散的老大难，让从零训练的少步模型质量逼近多步扩散。<strong>MeanFlow</strong>（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2505.13447v1\">arXiv:2505.13447</a>）则更激进：它引入「平均速度」恒等式，直接参数化一段区间的平均速度场，免去一致性模型需要的两时刻自一致约束，优化更稳——在 ImageNet-256 上单步 FID 约 2.85，是 2026 年从零单步生成的标杆。后续 SplitMeanFlow、AlphaFlow、改进版 MeanFlow（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/html/2512.02012v1\">arXiv:2512.02012</a>）等持续打磨这条路线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与步数蒸馏的关系-不是对手是邻居\">与步数蒸馏的关系：不是对手是邻居</h2><p>一致性模型常被和 DMD 类 <a href=\"step-distillation\">步数蒸馏</a> 并列，但二者的根本区别值得说清。<strong>步数蒸馏</strong>（尤其 DMD）的目标是让学生<strong>输出分布</strong>匹配老师分布，关注「终点分布」；<strong>一致性模型</strong>的目标是让函数在<strong>单条轨迹</strong>上自洽，关注「轨迹塌缩」。前者是分布层面的匹配，后者是几何层面的约束。</p>\n<p>实践中两条线在收敛：MeanFlow、shortcut models 这些 2025 年的「从零少步」方法，既可看作一致性的推广，也吸收了分布匹配与对抗的损失。所以在 <a href=\"../foundations/sampler-taxonomy\">求解器谱系</a> 里它们都落在「需蒸馏 / 少步」的同一区，是邻居而非对手。选择上的粗略经验：要给<strong>现成 SD 模型</strong>快速加速，用 LCM-LoRA 最省事；要<strong>从零训练</strong>一个少步模型追求极致单步质量，2026 年的首选是 MeanFlow / sCM 一系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么连续时间这么难训\">为什么连续时间这么难训</h2><p>CM 最初的离散版本能用，但有个隐患：它在时间轴上离散成若干段来定义相邻点对，这个离散化本身引入误差，且段数、噪声水平的选择极度敏感，训练常不稳。理论上最优的是<strong>连续时间</strong>一致性——让自一致性约束在无穷小时间间隔上成立，写成一个关于时间的微分约束。可这个连续版本一旦直接训练，梯度极易爆炸或退化，长期没人能稳定训出来。</p>\n<p>sCM（OpenAI 2025）的贡献正是攻克这个老大难：通过重新设计参数化、用 TrigFlow 统一框架、配合精心的时间权重和归一化，它让连续时间一致性模型第一次能稳定、可扩展地训练，质量逼近最好的多步扩散，且不再依赖离散段数这个脆弱超参。MeanFlow 则从另一个角度绕开——它不强加「两个时刻自洽」的约束，而是直接学一段区间的平均速度，把双时刻约束化简成单个恒等式，于是优化天然更稳。这两条 2025 年的进展，本质都是在回答同一个问题：怎么让「无穷小自洽」这个理论上最干净的目标，变成工程上训得动的损失。理解这个难点，你才明白为什么一致性家族迭代了三年才真正好用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"少步采样的确定性偏好\">少步采样的确定性偏好</h2><p>一致性模型几乎都走确定路线，这和 <a href=\"../solvers/ancestral-stochastic\">祖先与随机采样</a> 里的结论一脉相承：在 1~2 步的极端区间，随机注入的方差根本来不及被去掉，确定性才稳。CM 的多步采样虽然会「去噪→加噪→再去噪」，但那个加噪是受控的细化策略，不是反向 SDE 的纠错随机性。</p>\n<p>这也带来一个实用提醒：用 LCM 或一致性蒸馏模型时，要配套用它指定的采样器（如 ComfyUI 里的 LCM sampler）和极低的 <a href=\"../practice/guidance-cfg\">无分类器引导 CFG</a>（常 1~2，甚至关闭），否则会严重过曝或崩坏——因为这些模型在蒸馏时已把引导效应内化或重塑（详见 <a href=\"distillation-guidance\">引导蒸馏</a>）。把多步模型的高 CFG 习惯照搬到少步一致性模型上，是新手最常见的翻车点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>一致性模型训练一个函数，把 ODE 轨迹上任意点直接映射到起点（干净样本），从而单步成像，也可多步细化。</li>\n<li>训练有 CD（蒸馏，用老师轨迹）与 CT（从零，无老师）两途；约束核心是同轨迹不同点输出一致。</li>\n<li>家族快速演化：CM→LCM（潜空间+LoRA 即插）→sCM（稳定连续时间）→MeanFlow（平均速度，单步 FID≈2.85）。</li>\n<li>与步数蒸馏是邻居：蒸馏匹配输出分布，一致性约束单轨迹自洽，2025 年的从零少步方法在收敛融合。</li>\n<li>少步几乎都走确定路线，且须配低 CFG 与专用采样器，照搬多步高 CFG 习惯会翻车。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>另一条少步路线（分布匹配/对抗）：<a href=\"step-distillation\">步数蒸馏</a></li>\n<li>为何少步要配低引导，引导怎么被蒸进模型：<a href=\"distillation-guidance\">引导蒸馏</a></li>\n<li>确定性偏好的原理来源：<a href=\"../solvers/ancestral-stochastic\">祖先与随机采样</a></li>\n<li>跨库：少步采样在生成式技术栈的加速定位见 <a href=\"../../generative-ai/diffusion-models/diffusion-acceleration\">生成式 AI · 扩散加速</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"一致性模型","id":"一致性模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：自一致性约束","id":"核心概念-自一致性约束"},{"level":2,"text":"家族演化：CM → LCM → sCM → MeanFlow","id":"家族演化-cm-lcm-scm-meanflow"},{"level":2,"text":"与步数蒸馏的关系：不是对手是邻居","id":"与步数蒸馏的关系-不是对手是邻居"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么连续时间这么难训","id":"为什么连续时间这么难训"},{"level":2,"text":"少步采样的确定性偏好","id":"少步采样的确定性偏好"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"步数蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-sampling-solvers/acceleration/step-distillation"},"next":{"title":"引导蒸馏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-sampling-solvers/acceleration/distillation-guidance"}}